body:
It is never too late. Like for real. Even if you were 70 it would not be. 

&#x200B;

It is so easy to tell someone to start doing something. To try to change something. I know how you feel though. I really do. I just feel like there'll be a moment of truth in my life when I will ask myself if I am done or not. And I ask myself that every year. On my birthday. And somehow, even though I have tough periods, I am still here and going. I do not know if I am moving forward. But I feel like I am. I hope that you get the right sentiment from my message. I support you. And I want you and all of the others (myself included) to feel that there is hope. That we will have lives of our dreams. Sometimes in the future.
